<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Second half depends on economy - Coates.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Second half depends on economy - Coates.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equipment hire company Coates Hire Ltd said on Thursday the outlook for the second half of the year ending June 30, 1997 was heavily dependent on an improved rate of economic recovery.</p>
<p>&quot;Management remains committed to achieving the prospectus forecast and building on the potential of recent investments by the company,&quot; Coates said.</p>
<p>Coates, which listed on the Australian Stock Exchange in August last year after being sold by Australian National Industires, said net profit was A$6.61 million for the six months.</p>
</text>
